00:07:35.288 --> 00:07:36.539
- Uh, Bronx. I get my hair cut there.

00:07:36.539 --> 00:07:38.749
- Boogie Down. You got to.
They’re gonna cut your hair up. 

00:07:38.749 --> 00:07:39.542
[Laughing]
- Right?

00:07:39.542 --> 00:07:40.751
