00:07:49.427 --> 00:07:50.678
- Funniest teammate you’ve had?

00:07:50.678 --> 00:07:52.180
- Bartolo Colón.

00:07:52.180 --> 00:07:54.015
- Chewing gum or sunflower seeds?

00:07:54.015 --> 00:07:54.557
- Gum.

00:07:54.557 --> 00:07:55.975
- Worst fans in baseball?

00:07:55.975 --> 00:07:59.228
- Uh...

00:07:59.228 --> 00:08:01.397
I don’t know.
- 3, 2, 1.

00:08:01.397 --> 00:08:03.608
Come on you gotta say something.
You gotta say something! 

00:08:03.608 --> 00:08:04.150
- Uh.

00:08:04.150 --> 00:08:06.569
- I know you got somebody you can’t stand.

00:08:06.569 --> 00:08:08.488
- Uh, no no. Uh. Philly, man.

00:08:08.488 --> 00:08:11.157
I think the fans- they booed Santa Claus
from what I heard back in the day.

00:08:11.157 --> 00:08:12.450
- Philly fans are terrible.
That’s a great one to pick.

00:08:12.450 --> 00:08:13.034
- [Laughing]

00:08:13.034 --> 00:08:14.368
But they didn’t throw no
batteries at me though.

00:08:14.368 --> 00:08:15.745
- [Laughing]

00:08:15.745 --> 00:08:17.371
Curtis, appreciate you for
coming to the pool hall, man.

00:08:17.371 --> 00:08:18.164
- Thank you for having me.

00:08:18.164 --> 00:08:19.373
- Appreciate y’all for watching.

